// Electronic Prescription Group (ePG) examples with several electronic prescriptions (eP) each (ADR-003).
// Generated by a script; SNOMED CT codings declare the Irish Edition ($SCTIE); codes: NMPC VMPs (SNOMED CT Irish Edition, verified in the NMPC Meds Catalogue) through the
// Medication examples, which also carry SNOMED CT and ATC; SNOMED CT indications, routes, instructions and units of
// presentation checked on tx.fhir.org; UCUM for strength-based and liquid doses. All people are fictional.

// ═══ ePG 11: cardiovascular and diabetes review, four medicines ═══

