Description: "Four continuous electronic prescriptions issued together at a GP review: amlodipine, ramipril, atorvastatin (at night) and metformin (with food), each with 5 repeats. Two of the four have been dispensed so far, so the group is active with a mix of dispensed and not-yet-dispensed eP. Product-based doses use SNOMED CT units of presentation."
